<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Gompen, Sanna — Gompen, Sanna — standard return</name><desc>Walk from the Sanna express-boat dock through the village, then follow the old construction road west through the unlit tunnel to the ridge viewpoint between Mjåtinden and Gompen. Return by the same road and tunnel. Stay outside the radar station compound.

